# the forest. G major, light on its feet, a flute-ish tune over plucked arps
tempo 108
rows 4

inst pluck triangle vol 0.14 attack 0.002 decay 0.22 sustain 0.0
inst flute sine     vol 0.20 attack 0.03 decay 0.3 sustain 0.6 release 0.15 vibrato 0.01
inst bass  triangle vol 0.28 attack 0.005 decay 0.3 sustain 0.5 release 0.05
inst kit   drum     vol 0.16

pattern g
pluck G4 B4 D5 B4 | G4 B4 D5 B4 | G4 B4 D5 G5 | D5 B4 G4 B4
flute .  .  .  .  | D5 .  E5 .  | D5 .  B4 .  | G4 .  .  -
bass  G2 .  .  .  | D3 .  .  .  | G2 .  .  .  | D3 .  B2 .
kit   k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  .  | k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  h

pattern c
pluck C4 E4 G4 E4 | C4 E4 G4 E4 | C4 E4 G4 C5 | G4 E4 C4 E4
flute E5 .  .  .  | D5 .  C5 .  | E5 .  G5 .  | E5 .  .  -
bass  C3 .  .  .  | G2 .  .  .  | C3 .  .  .  | G2 .  E2 .
kit   k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  .  | k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  h

pattern em
pluck E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 G4 | E4 G4 B4 E5 | B4 G4 E4 G4
flute B4 .  .  .  | A4 .  G4 .  | A4 .  B4 .  | E4 .  .  -
bass  E2 .  .  .  | B2 .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .  | B2 .  G2 .
kit   k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  .  | k  .  h  k  | .  .  h  h

pattern d
pluck D4 F#4 A4 F#4 | D4 F#4 A4 F#4 | D4 F#4 A4 D5 | A4 F#4 D4 F#4
flute A4 .  .  .  | B4 .  C5 .  | D5 .  .  .  | F#5 . .  -
bass  D2 .  .  .  | A2 .  .  .  | D2 .  .  .  | A2 .  F#2 .
kit   k  .  h  .  | .  .  h  .  | k  .  h  .  | s  .  s  s

order g c g d g c em d
